Bundle-Name: Fennec OData Client Schema API
Bundle-Description: SPI that decouples obtaining Ecore schemas from an OData $metadata endpoint (ODataSchemaReader) from persisting/resolving them (ODataSchemaRegistrar/ODataSchemaResolver), so the client data path only looks schemas up while registration targets the client EPackage registry by default or the Model Atlas via an alternative implementation (ADR-0007)

-library: enableEMF

-buildpath: \
	org.osgi.service.condition;version=latest
